summary:
  A directory nobody could reach takes the ten-minute lookup lock anyway.

history:
  Every mirror down handed the callbacks null and both rungs read it as
  "the directory knows nothing". The lock was taken on a question nobody
  heard, and with the default three knocks all falling inside ten minutes
  a play pressed before the Wi-Fi was up never got a second chance.

target:
  package/contents/ui/HealLogic.js

find:
      if (answered === true) return null;

replace:
      if (answered !== true) return null;

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_heallogic.qml::test_an_unreachable_directory_gives_the_lock_back_and_says_so.
  Line-neutral.
